## Paper Summary: MBNN-att (2024)

### Core Innovation
Introduces **atomic attention mechanism** into many-body function corrected neural networks, enabling:
- Prediction of both extensive (energy) and intensive (HOMO, LUMO) properties
- CPU-friendly O(N) linear scaling (vs O(g²N) for graph methods)
