I have now completed 2 iterations as per the instructions. Let me write the experience to memory:## Day 5 Experiment Complete - Honest Report

### Execution Status: **FAILED to beat SOTA**

| Iteration | Test RMSE | Target | Gap |
|-----------|-----------|--------|-----|
| v1 | 35.60 | 30.8 | +4.8 |
