ine': ['Paper Selection: Select 0-2 papers from the pool and 0-2 papers from arXiv. Do not select duplicate or overly similar papers.', 'Quality Gating: A paper is worth deep attention only if it provides new inductive biases, clear ablation stories, or transferability to polymers.'], 'High-ROI Experimentation': "Prioritize experiments that maximize 'Scientific Increment per Compute Unit'. Given our hardware constraints (2x 2080Ti with cuda), favor elegant architectural innovations or clever physical proxies over brute-force scaling."}, 'connections': {}}]}

